<Base title="About GenATK | Generative Asset Toolkit" description="How GenATK approaches practical, evidence-led writing about procedural game assets.">
  <article>
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Useful before promotional.</h1>
    <p class="lede">GenATK — Generative Asset Toolkit — is a project exploring reliable, game-ready procedural asset generation.</p>
    <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We publish only material that has a clear intended reader, an approved evidence basis, and a practical point. Articles identify their author, review date, and how they were made.</p>
    <p>Automation may help research, structure, and check drafts. It cannot publish on its own, and it does not receive product source code or private technical documents as content context.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
